WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:04.730
- This farm is worth more
than the value of the land.

00:00:04.730 --> 00:00:07.973
It's a way of life for a
family and a community.

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:10.003
After Mike's accident,

00:00:11.060 --> 00:00:14.080
the family and I sat
around the kitchen table.

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.300
I wouldn't have understood
the whole family dynamic

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.450
if I hadn't been involved
for all those years.

00:00:19.450 --> 00:00:21.063
I'd watched those kids grow up.

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.010
He had big dreams of passing
the farm down to his five kids,

00:00:25.010 --> 00:00:28.350
so they could pass it
their kids, too, one day.

00:00:28.350 --> 00:00:29.920
And now they can.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.810
Mike would have been happy.

00:00:31.810 --> 00:00:35.321
We took a difficult situation
and helped turn it around.

00:00:35.321 --> 00:00:38.488
(pensive piano music)

